{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Rogue Orbit</strong>, time is both your enemy and ally.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage offers the chance to buy power-ups, shaping a unique gameplay experience with every run. Use the time you've earned to select different power-ups, each choice impacting your journey.  When the clock runs out, time's up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tiers of power-ups through repeated play, enhancing the depth and replayability of each run into this arcade-inspired space humble roguelite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Time is a critical resource: Manage it wisely by destroying enemies and choosing power-ups.  Don't get <i>too\u00a0</i>greedy! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Varied runs: Different power-ups available in each playthrough allow for diverse strategies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlockable power-up tiers: Repeated play unlocks more options, adding variety to your game. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There is no escape, just a higher score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is still in Active Development!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2850860?t=1771249850","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850860/451d3dc4b9a389f966e395e2a56c14dba766e802/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771249850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850860/62633c58c0d44e931e4ce4fcda0ea6611a564a17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771249850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850860/62633c58c0d44e931e4ce4fcda0ea6611a564a17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771249850","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"descript